<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="43" vertical-align="center">
      <h2>A life redirected by obligation</h2>
      <p>Kiều’s story advances through choices made under increasing pressure.</p>
      <smart-layout variant="minimalTimelineWithBoxes" orientation="vertical">
        <smart-layout-item>
          <h4>Love · Kim Trọng</h4>
          <p>They exchange vows and imagine a shared future.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <h4>Sacrifice · family crisis</h4>
          <p>Kiều sells herself to rescue her family.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <h4>Exploitation · Mã Giám Sinh and Tú Bà</h4>
          <p>Trafficking is followed by unstable refuge and persecution.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <h4>Reversal · Từ Hải</h4>
          <p>Power briefly opens before Hồ Tôn Hiến’s deception.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <h4>Return · Giác Duyên</h4>
          <p>Rescue leads to a transformed reunion, not a reset.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
      </smart-layout>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="17" padding="0">
      <ai-image prompt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a non-documentary literary figure crossing successive Vietnamese gates toward a distant river, the path narrowing through shadow and opening again at dawn, lampblack, vermilion, old gold and indigo, manuscript and woodblock conventions, no text or lettering" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" aspect-ratio="portrait" fill="true"/>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>